<http://data.silknow.org/object/25abe292-679d-3d3b-aeed-2b1b2960bdec/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Pair of wedding shoes of white kidskin. Heel-less slipper with a silk ribbon rosette, square toe and throat, white kidskin uppers, and a pair of folded side seams. White silk rosette at the throat, and the edges are bound with cream silk. White leather insole and quarter lining, and white linen vamp lining the brown leather sole."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/25abe292-679d-3d3b-aeed-2b1b2960bdec> .

